{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月14日，英偉達股價周五盤中一度下跌4.7%，本周累計跌幅擴大至約14%，勢將創下2025年4月以來最差單周表現。當時美國總統特朗普宣佈大範圍徵稅，引發全球股市劇烈震蕩。按市值計算，英偉達本周已蒸發逾6200億美元，勢將創下公司歷史最大單周市值損失紀錄。這一損失規模超過標普500指數中約97%的成分股各自的總市值。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586316.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T20:07:12.651260+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T19:57:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T20:00:23.340882+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T20:00:23.340882+00:00","content_hash":"38ea142fd778a0ff3b661e3a00c4358e76f9bd3faab7b6b27eb74d01523c26e9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}